    ],
    "notes": [
     "61.38 by R-159: no unit in a Cairo or Alexandria hex leaves it in the opening OpStage (Game-Turn 26 OpStage 3). From first on, per_opstage battalions a stage may leave; every land counter other than an HQ counts as one, a counts_as_one unit together with everything attached to it counts as one, and HQs leave freely.",
     "free: the 18th Australian Brigade lands at Alexandria on Game-Turn 27 OpStage 1 and may move from the next stage outside the limit.",
     "formations: the 7th Armoured Division has its own allowance on top of per_opstage: one tank battalion a stage once at least 75 % of its tank TOE points are repaired, and one other battalion a stage; its HQs leave freely.",
     "The limit applies to units in Cairo or Alexandria at the start; units arriving later by the schedule move normally (61.38: reinforcements are taken as they arrive)."
    ]
   }
